{"id":"P095-1","subject":"P","unit":"P095","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 51~68문항","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P095-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 51번","searchText":" 51\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 의하여 변압기 중성점을 접지하는\n\n경우, 변압기의 고압･특고압측 전로의 1선 지락전류가 30\n\nA 이고 1초 이내에 고압･특고압 전로를 자동으로 차단하\n\n는 장치를 설치할 때 변압기의 중성점 접지저항 값Ω은?\n\n\n① 10          ② 15\n\n③ 20          ④ 30\n\n⑤ 40","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m51","number":51},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m51-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m51-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1048}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 52번","searchText":" 52\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 따르면 소세력 회로에 전기를\n\n공급하기 위한 절연변압기의 사용전압은 대지전압 몇 V\n\n이하로 해야 하는가?\n\n\n① 100         ② 150\n\n③ 200         ④ 250\n\n⑤ 300","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m52","number":52},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m52-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m52-e1.webp","width":696,"height":834}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 53번","searchText":" 53\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에서, 다음 그림과 같은 계통접지\n\n방식은 무엇인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① TN-S         ② TN-C\n\n③ TN-C-S        ④ TT\n\n⑤ IT","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m53","number":53},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m53-q.webp","width":696,"height":717},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m53-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m53-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 54번","searchText":" 54\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 따라 합성수지관 공사를 할 때,\n합성수지관내에 28mm의 알루미늄도체를 넣는 경우,\n\n만족되어야 하는 도체의 형상은?\n\n\n① 단선         ② 연선\n\n③ 연동선        ④ 피복단선\n\n⑤ 나전선","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m54","number":54},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m54-q.webp","width":678,"height":487},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m54-e1.webp","width":678,"height":914}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 55번","searchText":" 55\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 따라 고압 옥내배선을 애자공사\n\n에 의해 시설할 때, 전선 지지점간 거리m이하인가?\n\n(단, 조영재를 따라 시설하는 경우가 아니다.)\n\n\n① 2           ② 3\n\n③ 5           ④ 6\n\n⑤ 7","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m55","number":55},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m55-q.webp","width":678,"height":484},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m55-e1.webp","width":678,"height":968}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 56번","searchText":" 56\n\n한국전기설비규정(KEC)에 따라 특고압 가공전선이 도로의\n\n위에서 교차하는 경우, 특고압 가공전선과 도로 사이에\n\n사이에 시설되는 보호망을 구성하는 금속선의 상호 간격은\n\n가로, 세로 각 몇 m이하이어야 하는가?\n\n\n① 0.5          ② 1.0\n\n③ 1.5          ④ 2.0\n\n⑤ 2.5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m56","number":56},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m56-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m56-e1.webp","width":696,"height":761}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 57번","searchText":" 57\n\n유효낙차가 183.7m일 때, 노즐에서 분사되는 분사수의\n\n이론상 분사속도는 약 몇 ms인가?\n\n\n① 40          ② 50\n\n③ 60          ④ 70\n\n⑤ 80","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m57","number":57},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m57-q.webp","width":678,"height":390},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m57-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1121}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 58번","searchText":" 58\n\n그림과 같이 태양전지 어레이(Array)를 설치하려고 한다.\n태양을 향한 방향의 장애물의 높이가 m일 때,\n장애물로부터 최소 이격거리m는?\n\n(단, 발전가능한계시각에서 어레이 밑단과 장애물 끝부분에\n\n 대한 각도는 그림과 같다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n①          ② \n③          ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m58","number":58},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m58-q.webp","width":696,"height":979},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m58-e1.webp","width":678,"height":987}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 59번","searchText":" 59\n\n다음 그림과 같은 배전방식은 무엇인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 망상식        ② 환상식\n\n③ 방사식        ④ 수지식\n\n⑤ 저압뱅킹방식","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m59","number":59},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m59-q.webp","width":696,"height":903},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m59-e1.webp","width":678,"height":895},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m59-e2.webp","width":696,"height":758}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 60번","searchText":" 60\n\nIEC에서 dischage voltage, KS에서 residual voltage로\n\n표기하는 제한전압에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 방전전류가 흐르는 동안 피뢰기 단자간에 나타나는\n\n  전압의 파고값\n\n② 상용주파수에서 방전을 개시하는 전압\n\n③ 피뢰기 단자간에 충격전압을 인가할 때 방전을 개시하는\n\n  전압의 최대치\n\n④ 속류를 차단할 수 있는 상용주파수 교류 최고전압\n\n⑤ 피뢰기 단자간에 충격전압을 인가할 때 방전을 개시하는\n\n  전압의 평균값","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m60","number":60},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m60-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m60-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1126}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 61번","searchText":" 61\n\n임피던스 ,  및 를 그림과 같이 접속한 선로의\n\n쪽에서 전압파 가 진행해 왔을 때 접속점 에서\n무반사로 되기 위한 Ω은?\n(단, 200Ω, 300Ω이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n① 100         ② 120\n\n③ 180         ④ 240\n\n⑤ 300","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m61","number":61},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m61-q.webp","width":678,"height":728},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m61-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 62번","searchText":" 62\n\n선간전압이 153kV인 3상 3선식 전선로에서 각 선의\n\n정전용량이 다음과 같을 때, 각 선의 정전용량의 차로 인\n\n한 중성점 잔류전압V은?\n\n       1.1F, 1F, 0.9F\n\n\n\n① 5100         ② 5200\n\n③ 5300         ④ 5400\n\n⑤ 5500","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m62","number":62},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m62-q.webp","width":678,"height":512},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m62-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1147}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 63번","searchText":" 63\n\n동기 발전기의 과도안정도를 향상시키는 방법으로 옳은 것\n\n은?\n\n     ㉠ 회전자의 관성계수를 작게 할 것\n\n     ㉡ 회전자의 플라이휠 효과를 크게할 것\n\n     ㉢ 속응여자방식을 채용할 것\n\n     ㉣ 고속도 차단방식을 채용할 것\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡㉢        ② ㉠㉢㉣\n\n③ ㉡㉢㉣        ④ ㉠㉡㉣\n\n⑤ ㉠㉡㉢㉣","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m63","number":63},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m63-q.webp","width":696,"height":618},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m63-e1.webp","width":696,"height":735}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 64번","searchText":" 64\n\n다음의 조건과 같은 동기발전기의 동기 임피던스Ω는?\n\n       ⦁정격전압 12kV\n\n       ⦁정격용량 24MVA \n       ⦁%임피던스 80\n\n\n\n① 1.2          ② 2.4\n\n③ 3.6          ④ 4.8\n\n⑤ 5.6","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m64","number":64},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m64-q.webp","width":696,"height":559},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m64-e1.webp","width":678,"height":752}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 65번","searchText":" 65\n\n그림과 같은 3상 3선식 1회선에서, 각 선의 대지 정전용\n량이 0.03Fkm, 선간 정전용량이 0.001\nFkm일 때, 작용 정전용량 Fkm은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 0.027        ② 0.030\n\n③ 0.032        ④ 0.033\n\n⑤ 0.036","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m65","number":65},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m65-q.webp","width":696,"height":706},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m65-e1.webp","width":678,"height":772}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 66번","searchText":" 66\n\n일정값 이상의 전압이 인가될 때, 회로를 차단하거나 경보\n\n를 알림으로써 회로를 보호하는 장치는?\n\n\n① 과전압 계전기     ② 방향계전기\n\n③ 지락과전류계전기   ④ 비율차동계전기\n\n⑤ 거리계전기","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m66","number":66},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m66-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m66-e1.webp","width":678,"height":359}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 67번","searchText":" 67\n\n경간이 50m인 가공전선로에서 가공전선 1m당 무게가\n\n0.2kg, 인장하중이 250kg일 때, 전선의 이도m는?\n\n\n① 0.15         ② 0.20\n\n③ 0.25         ④ 0.30\n\n⑤ 0.35","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m67","number":67},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m67-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m67-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1056}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P095-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피) · 객관식 68번","searchText":" 68\n\n전력계통에서 전압이 저하되는 경우의 문제점으로 옳지\n\n않은 것은?\n\n\n① 유효전력 손실이 증가한다.\n\n② 송전용량이 감소한다.\n\n③ 전압강하가 증가한다.\n\n④ 고주파가 발생한다.\n\n⑤ 전압 안정도가 감소한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 한국산업안전보건공단 (트리피)","originalId":"2025p2-e15-m68","number":68},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m68-q.webp","width":678,"height":757},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e15-m68-e1.webp","width":696,"height":826}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
